WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
- During the movie, you
celebrated your birthday

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.210
with, is it the mordida? Mordida?

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.043
- Yeah.
- Is that how you say it?

00:00:06.043 --> 00:00:08.510
- Okay, okay. I was trying to sound cool.

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.218
So could you explain what that is?

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.051
- Yeah.

00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:14.920
There is a tradition
that we have in Mexico

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.650
that when the cake comes,

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.480
you make a wish, you blow the candle,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.220
and then you take a bite of the cake,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.970
and then somebody behind
you whacks you on the head

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:26.380
and puts your face inside of the cake.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.200
Very normal in Mexico.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.200
And so, let me tell you, I
didn't have a birthday party.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.850
I just had a bunch of
people that just showed up.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:37.810
- And were they all signing up--

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:41.000
- But it was not like a
surprise party. No, no, no.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.320
They're like, you know,
it's your birthday,

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.040
we came to say hello. Where's the food?

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.110
But there was no party. But
it ended up being a party.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.290
And Angie, who's so lovely,

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.460
I had dinner with her the day before,

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.800
and she just came to bring me a gift,

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.730
but she kind of stayed.
So all of a sudden--

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.207
- She kind of stayed. Oh my God. (laughs)

00:00:57.207 --> 00:00:59.857
- All of a sudden, we were
like 15 people, 20 people.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.730
I was working there with my
team, so they just stayed also,

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.750
And we just had a like impromptu party.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
That's why you don't
see me all dressed up.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:10.920
And my agent sent me a
cake, so we did the mordida,

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.410
but Angie was sitting next to me, okay?

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:17.470
And when everybody started, "Mordida!"

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:19.090
She's like, what's happening?

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.290
And I said, oh, this is tradition,

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.780
and you're sitting next to
me, so you get to put...

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:27.280
She goes, I'm not gonna do
that! Are you guys kidding me?

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.510
I said, No, no, no, no.
Really, it's a tradition.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:31.970
Somebody whacks you in
the head inside of a cake.

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.150
- That's a weird tradition!
- And I said, yeah,

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.850
just do it, it's okay.
I can't, just do it.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.260
And all of a sudden she's like very girly.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.154
And all of a sudden she goes like, pwom!

00:01:40.154 --> 00:01:42.877
(Kelly laughing)
She was worse than Valentina!

00:01:42.877 --> 00:01:45.220
And I'm afraid of my daughter
when it comes to the mordida.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:48.067
But you know what? She'll
have a birthday coming.

